OL,3,AUS federal authorities could have
OL,4,Aprevented Epstein crimes, report finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrimes committed by the late disgraced
OL,7,Ffinancier Jeffrey Epstein after 2005
OL,8,Fcould have been prevented were it not
OL,9,Ffor "failures" by federal investigators
OL,10,Fand prosecutors, a congressional
OL,11,Finvestigation has concluded.
OL,13,FThe Republican-led US House Oversight
OL,14,FCommittee on Tuesday released its final
OL,15,Freport into what it described as the
OL,16,F"decades-long" mishandling of the
OL,17,Fcriminal investigations into Epstein
OL,18,Fand his long-term associate Ghislaine
OL,19,FMaxwell.
