OL,3,AUS federal authorities could have
OL,4,Aprevented Epstein crimes, report finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report's findings are based on
OL,7,Finterviews and depositions with
OL,8,Fwitnesses, government files, and
OL,9,Ffinancial records over a 15-month
OL,10,Fperiod.
OL,12,FEpstein died in 2019 as he awaited
OL,13,Ftrial on sex trafficking charges.
